"{\n    \"id\": \"Unique identifier for each record in the CRE or CMBS dataset. Used for indexing and referencing specific entries.\",\n    \"name\": \"Name of the individual, entity, or property associated with the CRE or CMBS data entry. Helps in identification and record-keeping.\",\n    \"age\": \"Age of the individual associated with the CRE or CMBS data, or the age of the property in years. Provides context for risk assessment or property valuation.\",\n    \"city\": \"The city where the commercial real estate property is located or where the CMBS transaction originated. Important for market analysis and geographical segmentation.\",\n    \"timestamp\": \"Date and time when the record was created or last updated. Crucial for tracking data freshness and historical analysis.\",\n    \"email\": \"Email address of the individual associated with the commercial real estate or CMBS data entry. Used for communication and identification purposes.\",\n    \"phone_number\": \"Contact phone number for the individual or entity associated with the CRE or CMBS data entry. Useful for direct communication and verification.\",\n    \"country\": \"The country where the commercial real estate property is located or where the CMBS is issued. Important for geographical analysis and regulatory considerations.\"\n}"